  "reference/pages.md": "# Captured pages\n\nDescriptions cite captured evidence; untested controls are not verified functionality.\n\n## Main Menu\n\nLauncher window with large toolbar buttons for Inventory, Orders, Suppliers and Reports, and a status bar showing the connected database and signed-in clerk. Reports was not opened.\n\nEvidence: 0f4b8e21-7c3a-4d59-b1e6-2a9d5c7f0384\n\n[Reference screenshot](screens/s7c1e4a90-0f4b8e21-7c3a-4d59-b1e6-2a9d5c7f0384.png)\n\n## Inventory\n\nSortable grid of stock items: SKU, description, bin, on hand and reorder point, with rows under the reorder point shaded. Toolbar has Find, Filter and Print; Print was not tested.\n\nEvidence: 5d2c91a7-e04b-4f63-8a1d-7b3e6c0f9152\n\n[Reference screenshot](screens/s7c1e4a90-5d2c91a7-e04b-4f63-8a1d-7b3e6c0f9152.png)\n\n## Item Detail\n\nSingle-item form for WID-0042 with read-only stock fields, cost history and an Adjust Stock… button. Edit mode was not entered.\n\nEvidence: b84e0d3f-29c6-4a17-95e2-c1f7a3d60b48\n\n[Reference screenshot](screens/s7c1e4a90-b84e0d3f-29c6-4a17-95e2-c1f7a3d60b48.png)\n\n## Adjust Stock\n\nModal dialog with a quantity delta, reason code dropdown and OK/Cancel. Closed with Cancel; the adjustment itself was not submitted.\n\nEvidence: 3a7f5c09-d1b2-4e86-a3c4-8f0b2e9d7165\n\n[Reference screenshot](screens/s7c1e4a90-3a7f5c09-d1b2-4e86-a3c4-8f0b2e9d7165.png)\n\n## Orders\n\nPurchase order list with number, supplier, status, order date and total, filtered to Open by default. New PO and Receive buttons were visible but not pressed.\n\nEvidence: c6e2a8d4-f913-4b07-8d5a-1e4c9b7f2036\n\n[Reference screenshot](screens/s9b2f07d3-c6e2a8d4-f913-4b07-8d5a-1e4c9b7f2036.png)\n\n## Order PO-10482\n\nOrder header (supplier, terms, dates) above a line-item grid with SKU, quantity and unit cost, plus a running total. Receive and Void were not tested.\n\nEvidence: 71b9d3e5-08a4-4c2f-b6e1-9d3a5f7c0824\n\n[Reference screenshot](screens/s9b2f07d3-71b9d3e5-08a4-4c2f-b6e1-9d3a5f7c0824.png)\n\n## Supplier Card\n\nPage content was not described; inspect the reference screenshot.\n\nEvidence: 2e8c4f61-a7d9-4b35-9c02-6f1e8b3d4a97\n\n[Reference screenshot](screens/s9b2f07d3-2e8c4f61-a7d9-4b35-9c02-6f1e8b3d4a97.png)\n\n",
